algorithms/ → algorithmic/DSA logic
components/ → UI/presentation
engine/ → visualization execution
hooks/ → reusable React state/behavior
utils/ → general helper functions

Operation       Data needed
────────────────────────────────
compare         index1, index2
swap            index1, index2
sorted          index
visit           node/index
insert          position + value
delete          position/index

